{"id": "hanson-bay-sand-royalty-settlement", "title": "How an affiliate’s sand price became a $42.2 million state settlement", "seconds": 71.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "45ca7f9dd977fd6d", "words": 165, "beats": [{"scene": "prices", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Hanson acquired two companies that held sand extraction leases in 1999.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.5, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "was", "the", "sand", "priced?"], "sub": "State sand leases"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 1.02, 1.35, 2.17, 2.36, 2.64, 2.99, 3.52, 3.91, 4.05, 4.55]}, {"scene": "prices", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The leases included sales to affiliates and to outside customers.", "t0": 5.62, "t1": 9.73, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "leases", "kicker": "California State Lands Commission", "text": "Royalty formula", "mark": "Royalty formula"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.6, 1.11, 1.49, 1.62, 2.47, 2.82, 2.92, 3.39]}, {"scene": "prices", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The royalty was 23 percent of the weighted average dock price, multiplied by volume.", "t0": 9.85, "t1": 15.3, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "23%", "label": "Royalty on the weighted average dock price times volume"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.67, 0.88, 1.44, 1.84, 1.92, 2.03, 2.38, 2.74, 3.02, 4.01, 4.69, 4.88]}, {"scene": "prices", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A whistleblower filed in 2001. California intervened in 2003.", "t0": 15.42, "t1": 20.95, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "complaint", "kicker": "California Department of Justice", "text": "Complaint", "mark": "Complaint"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.79, 1.25, 1.39, 1.6, 2.05, 2.87, 3.62, 4.25, 4.38, 4.63, 5.08]}, {"scene": "prices", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The state alleged that sand was transferred to affiliates at a discount before resale.", "t0": 21.07, "t1": 26.9, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "State allegations", "heading": "Reported price and average sales price per cubic yard", "source": "doj", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Reported", "value": "$3.30"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Average sales", "value": "$12.50"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.64, 1.55, 1.79, 2.2, 2.37, 2.98, 3.1, 4.04, 4.24, 4.32, 4.86, 5.23]}, {"scene": "prices", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The state also alleged extraction outside leased areas. The companies disputed the claims.", "t0": 27.02, "t1": 33.32, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Lease boundaries"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.52, 0.87, 1.31, 2.13, 2.68, 3.01, 4.42, 4.6, 5.09, 5.67, 5.77]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The civil settlement totaled 42.2 million dollars.", "t0": 33.54, "t1": 38.23, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$42.2 million", "label": "Civil settlement covering the consolidated claims"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.64, 1.17, 1.66, 2.35, 2.69, 3.21, 4.02]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The defendants expressly denied wrongdoing.", "t0": 38.35, "t1": 40.82, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "judgment", "kicker": "California Department of Justice", "text": "Stipulated judgment", "mark": "Stipulated judgment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.7, 1.45, 1.82]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "At least $23 million was due under the first installment terms.", "t0": 40.94, "t1": 45.64, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "judgment", "kicker": "California Department of Justice", "text": "Stipulated judgment", "mark": "Stipulated judgment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.46, 1.47, 2.02, 2.47, 2.67, 2.96, 3.16, 3.27, 3.63, 4.21]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The balance was due January 5, 2008.", "t0": 45.76, "t1": 49.25, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Balance due"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.76, 1.14, 1.8, 2.57, 2.78, 3.17]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Attorney General separately reported more than $6 million in royalties already paid.", "t0": 49.37, "t1": 55.61, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "doj", "kicker": "California Department of Justice", "text": "Attorney General’s announcement", "mark": "Attorney General’s announcement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.58, 1.06, 1.54, 2.01, 2.16, 2.38, 2.98, 3.73, 4.73, 4.93, 5.41, 5.82]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The revised leases set a $2.09 rate per cubic yard and required GPS tracking.", "t0": 55.73, "t1": 62.34, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "State Lands Commission", "heading": "The revised lease terms", "source": "leases", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Royalty", "value": "$2.09 per cubic yard"}, {"icon": "map", "label": "Extraction boundaries", "value": "GPS tracking"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.73, 1.19, 1.43, 1.54, 1.79, 2.22, 2.36, 2.67, 3.03, 3.3, 3.52, 3.93, 4.61, 4.91, 5.51, 6.06]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The judgment directs payment to California. The final allocation needs a separate record.", "t0": 62.46, "t1": 67.66, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Settlement receipts", "Final allocation"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.65, 1.09, 1.5, 1.6, 2.82, 3.04, 3.41, 4.04, 4.29, 4.38, 4.78]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 67.78, "t1": 70.41, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"prices": "Which price counted?", "agreement": "What did the settlement resolve?"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "question"}